//RS // D-JOS-NIXBACKEND1=C (card #363): every `SystemPlan` option/service/package
//RS // that this backend cannot map to a NixOS setting is collected and reported
//RS // in ONE diagnostic (E1291) before `nix` ever runs — no silent omissions,
//RS // mirroring the import-direction discipline in D-JOS-NIXIMPORT1=C.
