//RS // Unit-tested directly: the real-guest CLI path is gated by `require_real_vm_tools`
//RS // (E1290), which byte-scans every VM tool on PATH and rejects any file whose
//RS // bytes contain "fake" — several genuine dev-shell binaries (e.g. `zstd`,
//RS // `mkfs.vfat`) happen to contain that 4-byte sequence somewhere in their
//RS // compiled data, so no environment observed so far can drive this path
//RS // through the CLI. `map_system_to_nixos`/rendering/planning are pure and
//RS // deterministic, so they are tested here instead of via `tests/jetpack_jetos.rs`.
//RS #[cfg(test)]
